    <string name="template_intro_units">Dates as DD-MM-YYYY. Amounts in rupees. Quantity in litres (petrol, diesel, LPG), kg (CNG) or kWh (electric).</string>
    <string name="template_intro_triangle">For fill-ups, fill any two of quantity, price per unit and total. The third is worked out.</string>
    <string name="template_intro_import">Save the file, then import it from Garage → Import data. Duplicates are skipped, and you can undo an import.</string>
